Value Required LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value NEIGHBOR_PORT_ID (.*)
Value NEIGHBOR_NAME (.*)
Value NEIGHBOR_DESCRIPTION (.*)
Value MGMT_ADDRESS (.*)
Value CAPABILITIES (.*)

# Built from a real `show lldp neighbor-info detail` capture off an
# ArubaOS-CX 6300-series switch. Not yet exercised through `go test` in the
# environment this was authored in (no Go toolchain available) — the field
# mapping is real, but the state machine itself wants a live test run
# before being trusted on a production crawl.
#
# Record boundary is the next "Port :" line rather than the trailing dash
# separator, because the LAST block in a real capture has no trailing
# separator before the stripped prompt. The very last record in the file
# therefore still depends on gotextfsm's implicit EOF-Record when no
# explicit EOF state is defined — standard TextFSM behavior, but the one
# assumption in this file that most wants confirming.
Start
  ^Port\s*:\s*\S+\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^Port\s*:\s*${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor\s+Entries\s
  ^Neighbor\s+System-Name\s*:\s*${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor\s+System-Description\s*:\s*${NEIGHBOR_DESCRIPTION}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor\s+Chassis-ID\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor\s+Management-Address\s*:\s*${MGMT_ADDRESS}\s*$$
  ^Chassis\s+Capabilities\s+Available
  ^Chassis\s+Capabilities\s+Enabled\s*:\s*${CAPABILITIES}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor\s+Port-ID\s*:\s*${NEIGHBOR_PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor\s+Port-Desc
  ^Neighbor\s+Port\s+VLAN
  ^Neighbor\s+Port\s+MFS
  ^Link\s+aggregation
  ^Aggregation\s+port\s+ID
  ^TTL\s*:
  ^-+\s*$$
  ^LLDP\s+Neighbor\s+Information\s*$$
  ^=+\s*$$
  ^Total\s+Neighbor\s+Entries
  ^\s*$$
  ^.* -> Error
